# held/props/handdrums: a pair of small hand drums at the waist for the Drum posture's Hand and Tabla variants (PROPS, P2b):
# a tall and a squat drum with pale heads, the hands beating in turn (hold, low). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on
# the right shoulder, under the hands.
